contract.frontend:
Registry `commission-configurations`: `generateEditRoute: false`, `detailOwnsEditAction: true`,
`formOwnsHeader: true`; `CommissionConfigurationDetailView` perde `onEdit`, guadagna `onChanged`;
`updateCommissionConfiguration` restituisce `CommissionConfigurationDetailWithPermissions`;
`commissionConfigurationDetailKey` gia' esportata; hook del form in edit con `values`/`keepDirtyValues`/
`clearServerError`; wrapper solo creazione (`useResourceMeta`); `EditLoader` rimosso; i18n
`form.leaveConfirm.*`.
